Rule 2 (valid dimension index with negative indices; tensors share rank)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor, v_3: int} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ 1 ≤ ndim(v_1) ∧ 0 - ndim(v_1) ≤ v_3 ∧ v_3 < ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 3 (broadcastable across non-reduction dims; equal size on the reduction dim)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor, v_3: int} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : if i = (if v_3 ≥ 0 then v_3 else v_3 + ndim(v_1)) then shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) else (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1)
>>
Rule 4 (epsilon must be positive)
{v_4: float} |= v_4 > 0
